===Velar stems===

The velar stems, also called "guttural stems", belonged to the larger class of "consonant stems", which mostly shared the same endings. They were masculine or feminine, and had a stem ending in a velar consonant, ''ch'', ''g'' ({{IPA|/ɣ/}}) or ''c'' {{IPA|/ɡ/}}. The final consonant itself was lost in the nominative and vocative singular. Word-final palatalised ''-ich'' was voiced to ''-ig'', partially merging the two types.

